{"id": "bench-p01", "instruction": "在原点建一个 20x20x20 的方块，把它整体放大到 1.5 倍；然后在放大后方块的顶面正中心紧贴放一个半径 4 的纯红色球体。", "tags": ["perception", "scale", "stack"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 2}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "props": {"size": [30, 30, 30]}, "tol": 1.0}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "props": {"size": [8, 8, 8], "color": [255, 0, 0]}, "tol": 0.8}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"type": "Surface"}, "b": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.2}]}
{"id": "bench-p02", "instruction": "画一个半径 15 的圆，沿 Z 轴向上拉伸 25 形成一个圆柱体；然后在这个拉伸体的顶面正中心紧贴放一个 10x10x10 的方块。", "tags": ["perception", "extrude", "stack"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"size": [30, 30, 25]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"size": [10, 10, 10]}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"size": [10, 10, 10]}, "b": {"size": [30, 30, 25]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.2}]}
{"id": "bench-p03", "instruction": "建 3 个底面 10x10 的方块，高度分别为 10、30、20，依次放在 X=0、X=20、X=40（底面均在 Z=0）。然后在这三个方块中最高的那个的顶面正中心紧贴放一个半径 5 的纯红色球体。", "tags": ["perception", "select", "stack"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": ["Polysurface", "Extrusion"]}, "n": 3}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "spatial", "a": {"type": "Surface"}, "b": {"size": [10, 10, 30]}, "relation": "on_top_of", "tol": 1.2}]}
{"id": "bench-p04", "instruction": "建一个半径 20 的纯白色球体放在原点。等等，我觉得太大了——把它缩小成半径 12，再把颜色改成纯蓝色。", "tags": ["perception", "edit", "revision"], "difficulty": 3, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "props": {"size": [24, 24, 24], "color": [0, 0, 255]}, "tol": 0.8}]}
{"id": "bench-p05", "instruction": "沿 X 轴建 3 个半径 5 的球体，球心分别在 X=0、X=15、X=30（Y=Z=0）。删掉中间那个球，然后用一条直线连接剩下两个球的球心。", "tags": ["perception", "edit", "line"], "difficulty": 4, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Surface"}, "n": 2}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"type": "Curve"}, "n": 1}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"type": "Curve"}, "props": {"size": [30, 0, 0]}, "tol": 1.0}]}
{"id": "bench-p06", "instruction": "搭一张简易桌子：先建一个 60x40x4 的桌面板；在桌面板下方的四个角各放一根 4x4x30 的桌腿，桌腿顶面紧贴桌面板底面；最后把桌面板和四条腿打成群组「桌子」。", "tags": ["perception", "compose", "group"], "difficulty": 5, "asserts": [{"kind": "count", "selector": {}, "n": 5}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"in_group": "桌子"}, "n": 5}, {"kind": "count", "selector": {"size": [4, 4, 30]}, "n": 4}, {"kind": "property", "selector": {"size": [60, 40, 4]}, "props": {"size": [60, 40, 4]}, "tol": 0.8}]}
